put one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming and Xiao Yun are classmates, they are preparing a group project. Today, the teacher asks each group to share their progress. Xiao Ming is very confident in his ideas, he prepares to share at the meeting. Before the discussion starts, Xiao Yun tells Xiao Ming that she can help him share to avoid his nervousness, Xiao Ming does not speak, they look at Xiao Ming's speech together. After the meeting starts, Xiao Yun raises her hand to speak, showing her ideas to the teacher and the class leader. Xiao Ming finds that Xiao Yun's ideas are very similar to his own, and he is stunned for a while. The teacher and the class leader both affirm this idea, Xiao Yun turns her head and gives Xiao Ming a smile. Xiao Ming seems to understand.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Xiao Ming do next?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Ming tries to change his view of this situation, tells himself that Xiao Yun just wants to help him, and he should feel happy instead of depressed.\nB. Xiao Ming can discuss his feelings with Xiao Yun privately, explain that he originally plans to share this idea, and seek Xiao Yun's understanding and support.\nC. Xiao Ming decides to ignore this matter, starts to focus on the study of other courses, in order to divert his attention.\nD. Xiao Ming chooses to find the teacher after class to explain the situation, and asks to share his ideas again.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a6cc2ddb05a7fe2e06e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452076141,"create